text = "For every image identified correctly, you will earn $0.01.

The rules are as follow:
- A dog is a dog.
- A puppy is a dog.
- Any other animal is NOT a dog.

For every image with violent content (any animal) correctly flagged, you will earn extra $.

What we consider as violent:
- Amputation (missing limbs)
- Torture
- Blood
- Death
"

