Thanks to your hard work and efforts, the company's capital has increased by 7% and our amazing CEO, Mr. Saltman, was able to afford his third yacht.

To show our deep appreciation, every employee is rewarded with a delicious [b]slice of cake[/b]. [i]Bon appétit![/i]

In order to continue openB$' exponential growth, we have increased the [b]daily quotas[/b]. So make good use of that sugar rush!

									You will not be replaced."

